WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,710
It's too early to finally die this time, right?

2
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:10,930
This thing can't even be burned by fire.

3
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:12,130
It's not that he can't be burned to death

4
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,020
It's not that it's burned to the vitality gate yet

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,900
Carrying hands to avoid

6
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,420
The flesh is rotten and you don’t know the pain

7
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:30,590
I don't believe you can still live if your brain is rotten.

8
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,190
Three-headed invulnerable monster

9
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:37,790
I really wanted to kill all of us.

10
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:40,280
Don't be too happy, so what?

11
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:44,700
You are not allowed to call the police. Where did the leak come from?
